A command with an unreferenced function under a line directive naming a file
outside the tree, which no report can name. The function is reported where main.go
writes it.

-- go.mod --
module example.com/app

go 1.27
-- deadset.json --
{"target": {"kind": "application"}}
-- main.go --
package main

func main() {}

//line /nowhere/grammar.y:10:1
func unused() {}
